    "summary": "You may pay 1 **Pain token** in your [Movement phase](vsdata:core-rule/movement-phase) to make this unit [Empowered](vsdata:ability/drukhari.power-from-pain). A model from the [Empowered](vsdata:ability/drukhari.power-from-pain) unit arriving by [Deep Strike](vsdata:core-ability/deep-strike) may use this placement option if its horizontal gap from every enemy unit exceeds 6″. If this placement puts the unit within 8″ of any enemy unit, it cannot declare a charge that turn.",
